# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloud — Bandile alone. Deliberately last: last match wins, so these override
# the /.github/ and /scripts/ lanes above for the files that decide what gets
# deployed, where, and with what permissions.
#
# The contract tests and acceptance docs are listed too. A change that weakens
# the test guarding a deploy script is a change to that deploy script, and must
# not be able to route around the owner by touching only /scripts/.
#
# This file is listed so that the rule cannot be edited away by the people it
# applies to.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/infra/                                          @bandilleee
/.github/CODEOWNERS                              @bandilleee
/.github/workflows/deploy-staging.yml            @bandilleee
/.github/workflows/nightly-staging.yml           @bandilleee
/scripts/tests/test_staging_infrastructure.py    @bandilleee
/scripts/tests/test_forecast_deployment.py       @bandilleee
/docs/deploy-staging-acceptance.md               @bandilleee
/docs/forecast-deployment.md                     @bandilleee
